  "summary": "Lightwell Security Advisory: awscli 1.42.61+rhlw.1",
  "details": "Red Hat Lightwell has released awscli 1.42.61+rhlw.1 with backported fixes for CVE-2026-13769 and CVE-2026-18654.\n\nCVE-2026-13769: Overly permissive File Permissions in AWS CLI\n\nCVE-2026-18654: Disabled SSH host key verification in Amazon AWS CLI EMR helper commands\n\nThis patched artifact is a drop-in replacement for awscli 1.42.61 from PyPI.",
